### Campaign Management API Requests
# Use this file to test the campaign endpoints in IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code REST Client.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@campaignId = 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555
@categoryId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### 0. Login as Seeded Admin User (200 OK)
# Only ADMIN users can manage or list campaigns.
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminAccessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 1. Create Campaign (201 Created)
POST {{host}}/v1/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{campaignId}}",
  "name": "Seasonal Keyboard Sale",
  "description": "Applies a 15 percent discount to keyboards above 50 EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2027-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "discountPercent": 15,
  "predicates": [
    {
      "predicateType": "IN_CATEGORY",
      "value": "{{categoryId}}"
    },
    {
      "predicateType": "IS_MORE_EXPENSIVE_THAN",
      "value": "5000"
    }
  ]
}

### 2. List Campaigns with Optional Filters (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/v1/campaigns?name=Seasonal&description=keyboards&status=ACTIVE&startDate=2026-06-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2027-06-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Update Campaign (200 OK)
PUT {{host}}/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Extended Keyboard Sale",
  "description": "Applies a 20 percent discount to all keyboards under 200 EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2027-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "discountPercent": 20,
  "predicates": [
    {
      "predicateType": "IN_CATEGORY",
      "value": "{{categoryId}}"
    },
    {
      "predicateType": "IS_CHEAPER_THAN",
      "value": "20000"
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Create Campaign - Validation Error (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/v1/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555556",
  "name": "Invalid Discount Campaign",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "startDate": "2026-12-10T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "discountPercent": 120,
  "predicates": []
}

### 5. Delete Campaign (204 No Content)
DELETE {{host}}/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 6. Delete Non-Existent Campaign (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{host}}/v1/campaigns/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

